                                "sense_id": "16470399-5c3e-3512-aeca-40f662529a67",
                                "text": "In 1887, E. H. Parker,¹ writing upon this subject, reported the cost for the southern Huai region as having been formerly Tls. 4000 each, i.e. $2600, but as reduced to Tls. 3600 or $2,340."
