                                "sense_id": "16470399-5c3e-3512-aeca-40f662529a67",
                                "text": "It is located in the western suburb of Tianjiaan, Huainnan^([sic – meaning Huainan]) City, Anhui Province. Like a multi-colored band, it joins together the railroad and highway which cut across the north and south Huai regions."
